DECLARE Party IS ONE OF Borrower, Lender, Stranger
DECLARE Act IS ONE OF Pay HAS payer IS A Party, to IS A Party, amount IS A NUMBER

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party Act
g MEANS
  PARTY Borrower
  MUST Pay Borrower Lender 10
  WITHIN 5
  HENCE FULFILLED
  LEST BREACH

#TRACE g AT 0 WITH
  PARTY Lender DOES Pay Borrower Lender 10 AT 2
